WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.680
The whole console, in under a minute. It starts with one recording from one volunteer, and the two words anyone wrote about it.

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:16.577
So we measure it. The observation page draws the evidence for a single pass. The live page does the same for any pass you name.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:25.957
Every pass is scored on what disagrees, and four hundred and seven go in order, so the fifty a reviewer can open are the fifty worth opening.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:39.580
Everything else is proof. Evaluation holds the gates, including the ones that did not pass. Agent is the same evidence reached by a model. Provenance says where every number came from, and precedent says what was already known before this.

00:00:40.117 --> 00:00:44.517
That is the map. nine pages, and every arrow ends at a receipt.
